Bind Npc 24430 Zone 1
Quest 419 "[Repeatable Solo] Ape Hunt"
    Repeat always
    Journal "[Mercenary] Russell has commissioned you to hunt Ape. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Kill 20 of 4251, 4201 at direction_113

Requires player level >= 44 and player is karus

Rewards
    Give 1000000 experience or 1400000 with premium

direction_113 = location "Ape" about "Ape\nGiant Large carnivore inhabiting the jungle, distinguishing trait: attacks loot with ambushes, primary attack method: brandishes powerful arms and pulls and twists target" found "Karus" karus at 206 1340 in zone 1

On available
    Say "And with Apes causing a headache recently, the injury to Russel is really a bad news.\n\nMmm... How about dealing with the Ape problem yourself, master?\n\nYou might like to know that the Apes around here are enormous meat-eating bastards who favor surprise attacks. So, like, be careful!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "The Apes around here are acting up...It's actually a serious problem because Rage is out of action."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Not long ago, I was wounded in battle and I wanted to call you for help, but you already had too many missions, and no one else could help."

On in_progress
    Say "Apes..."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_113

On ready
    Say "Master, you tried hard. Let's go and claim the reward."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "You've subdued those damned Apes? Thank you very much ? This is a sign of my appreciation, use it well."
